OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed 82-year-old in
OL,4,Arandom attack sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA killer who stabbed a granddad to
OL,7,Fdeath on his front garden in a random
OL,8,Fattack while under a delusion he was a
OL,9,Fpaedophile has been given a hospital
OL,10,Forder.
OL,12,FGerard Ring, 82, died in hospital three
OL,13,Fdays after he was stabbed by Julian
OL,14,FDonoher outside his home in Whitecross
OL,15,FGardens, off Kedleston Road in Derby,
OL,16,Fon 6 September 2025.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
