OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed 82-year-old in
OL,4,Arandom attack sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FRing's youngest daughter, Sapphire
OL,7,FGreatorex, said her dad was "giant of a
OL,8,Fman" who was "very reliable, very
OL,9,Fmoral, who worked very hard but was
OL,10,Fgenerous with his time, generous with
OL,11,Fhelping other people".
OL,13,FAt Derby Crown Court on Tuesday,
OL,14,FDonoher, 51, was detained under the
OL,15,FMental Health Act after pleading guilty
OL,16,Fto manslaughter by reason of diminished
OL,17,Fresponsibility.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
